  "description": "1 Bed | 1 Bath | Newly Refurbished | Gated Development\niLiv Property Management is delighted to present 15 Millbrook Court, Kilmainham, Dublin 8, a superb one-bedroom apartment which has undergone a complete refurbishment by iBuild and is presented in excellent, turnkey condition.\nSituated within the mature and secure gated Millbrook Court development, the apartment offers bright, comfortable and modern accommodation in a highly convenient Dublin 8 location.\nThe property has been newly refurbished throughout by iBuild, with considerable attention given to the quality of the finish and overall presentation. The apartment is fully furnished and ready to occupy.\nThe accommodation comprises a bright and spacious living and dining area, a newly fitted contemporary kitchen with excellent storage and modern appliances, a generous double bedroom with built-in wardrobe space, and a newly finished modern bathroom.\nThe refurbishment has created a fresh and contemporary home while retaining a comfortable and practical layout, making the apartment completely ready for its next tenancy.\nExcellent Kilmainham Location\nMillbrook Court is ideally positioned in the heart of Kilmainham, Dublin 8, with an excellent range of amenities and transport connections nearby.\nSt James’s Hospital and the National Children’s Hospital are close by, while Heuston Station, the Red Luas Line and numerous Dublin Bus services provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\nThe area offers a wide selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities, with Kilmainham Gaol, IMMA, the Irish National War Memorial Gardens and Phoenix Park also within easy reach.\nKey Features\n- Newly refurbished throughout by iBuild\n- 1 double bedroom\n- 1 modern bathroom\n- Secure gated development\n- Bright and spacious living accommodation\n- Newly fitted contemporary kitchen\n- Modern appliances\n- Excellent bedroom storage\n- Fully furnished\n- Fresh, modern interior throughout\n- Excellent Kilmainham location\n- Close to St James’s Hospital and the National Children’s Hospital\n- Convenient to Heuston Station and the Red Luas Line\n- Excellent access to Dublin City Centre\n- Shops, cafés, restaurants and local amenities nearby\n- Ready to occupy\n- Managed by iLiv Property Management, including ongoing tenancy and maintenance management\nThis is a beautifully presented, newly refurbished and turnkey one-bedroom apartment in an excellent Dublin 8 location. Early viewing is highly recommended.",
